                                                "sense_id": "bb53119b-2cf5-3299-b7a6-dd5c19cf8e11",
                                                "text": "“I'd admit the past & monsterize myself in the eyes of the jury,” he wrote. “I would try to be emotionless, to add credibility to that monsterization."
